{'symbol': 'BEN', 'date': '2022-04-04 09:00:00', 'title': 'FRANKLIN TEMPLETON COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF LEXINGTON PARTNERS, A GLOBAL LEADER IN SECONDARY PRIVATE EQUITY AND CO-INVESTMENTS', 'text': 'SAN MATEO, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FRANKLIN RESOURCES, INC. [NYSE:BEN], A GLOBAL INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT ORGANIZATION OPERATING AS FRANKLIN TEMPLETON, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPLETION OF ITS ACQUISITION OF LEXINGTON PARTNERS L.P. (“LEXINGTON”), A LEADING GLOBAL MANAGER OF SECONDARY PRIVATE EQUITY AND CO-INVESTMENT FUNDS, ON APRIL 1, 2022. WITH THIS CLOSING, FRANKLIN TEMPLETON SIGNIFICANTLY EXPANDS THE BREADTH AND SCALE OF ITS ALTERNATIVE ASSET STRATEGIES WITH OVER $200 BILLION IN AGGREGATE ALTERNA'}